{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105998","id":2494665691,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6UsZPb","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105998","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105998.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105998.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105998","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105998/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105998/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105998/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/6d564a48088a7f1ec52cd9d300b9b95dba3ac278","number":105998,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"GDScript: Reserve local function Vectors with known final size","user":{"login":"DeeJayLSP","id":60024671,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMDI0Njcx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60024671?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP","html_url":"https://github.com/DeeJayLSP","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Many functions in the GDScript codebase create a temporary `Vector` to push back a few structs. In some cases, however, the final size is already known, so reserve is possible.\r\n\r\nI have modified some cases that meet the following requirements:\r\n- The Vector/Array is instantiated within the function's scope.\r\n- The amount of iterations in the `for` loop are pre-defined.\r\n- There are no conditions that will deny the `push_back` from happening, with exception of conditions that end the function early.\r\n\r\nI measured a slight performance increase when running [Bunnymark](https://github.com/GaijinEntertainment/godot-das/tree/master/examples/bunnymark) with 500 bunnies, an amount I presume is reasonable for common cases.\r\n\r\nAlso:\r\n- CPU usage is between 0.4% less and 0.1% more (on an Intel Core i5-11400H).\r\n- RAM usage is between 4MB lower and 1MB higher (less memory fragmentation?).\r\n- Template release build size increased by 12KiB, which I believe to be too big for this improvement.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098082,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwODI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gdscript","name":"topic:gdscript","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance","name":"performance","description":"","color":"447777","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x